KZ2 patch 2091: prompt atlases and keycap prompts. From Project Helghast port/patches/2039-keycap-prompts-atlas-cells.patch
(rsx_keycaps.h: atlas fingerprint, cell tables, BC3 codec, keycaps; live-draw upload hook and in-place refresh; cellPad
pad_kb_key_for_input), with the rsx_keycaps.h half of KZ3 2058 (cells exact) re-done: KZ2 2058 carried only its PSO part.
KZ2 changes: the fingerprints and cells are Killzone 2's (HUD ButtonIconCollection #198 Texture #363
1024x512 DXT5 FNV-1a 64 LE c19c0aab100b3a40, menu legend Font imagemapsmall 512x128 DXT5 628d1888308cc95c, 34x35 cells
in US glyph order); BC3 colour decodes in four-colour mode always; the new cells go through an overlay encoded once, a
block partly outside every cell keeps its endpoints and outside indices (exact on any decoder); kc_kind/kc_sig live in
texcache_t (KZ3's hunk context would have put them into zdepth_t here); KZ2_KEYCAPS=0 turns it off (KZ3_KEYCAPS),
LD_KEYCAP_DBG=1 logs every candidate fingerprint. The source (keys, text) comes from port/kz2/kz2_prompts.cpp.
Host test: tools/runtime/test_prompt_glyphs.sh.

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.18.0: context and offsets only.

